                    </div>
                    <p><span style="font-weight: 600">RJ Kapdaaz</span> was founded in <span style="font-weight:600;">2022</span> with a commitment to providing top-notch textile solutions for both personal and professional needs. Based in Surat, Gujarat and especially  <span style="font-weight: 600">Made in India,</span> our product range spans two core categories: Linen and Uniforms, both designed to meet the highest standards of excellence and durability.</p>

                    <P><span style="font-weight: 600">In our Linen Collection,</span> we exclusively use products from <span style="font-weight: 600"> Welspun India.</span> We include a variety of products designed to offer supreme comfort and durability, such as Bed Linen, Hospital Linen, Mattresses, Pillows & Cushions, Bed Runners, Duvets & Comforters, Blankets, Bath Mats, Napkins, and Bath Towels. Whether you’re furnishing a home, hospital, or hotel, our products promise unmatched quality and style.</P>

                    <P><span style="font-weight: 600">In our Uniforms Collection,</span> we work with trusted brands such as <span style="font-weight: 600">Mafatlal, S.Kumars, Siyarams, and Valji.</span> Our collection is tailored to meet the unique needs of professionals across various sectors. We provide high-quality uniforms for Hospitals, Hotels, and the Corporates, including T-shirts, Aprons, Kurtas, Blazers, Waistcoats, and Safari suits. Every garment is designed with precision to ensure comfort, ease of movement, and a polished look for your team.</P>

                    <P><span style="font-weight: 600">At RJ Kapdaaz,</span> we are committed to innovation, quality, and customer satisfaction. Our products are crafted from the finest materials, ensuring that each item is both stylish and functional, giving our customers the best experience possible.</P>

                    <p>We are specialist in any kind of linen and uniform category product and create a setup to meet the multi-faceted challenges of the hospitality industry as well as the corporate industry under one roof, this thing happened and is possible through their founder’s vast 10 years of experience particular for this industry.</p>
                   
